# Paths whose change makes the test workflows (tests.yaml, e2e.yaml) run their tests. On a pull
# request that touches none of them (docs, plans, .claude, README) the steps are skipped and the
# job still reports green, so the required checks pass. One extended regex per line, matched with
# `grep -E` against `git diff --name-only`. Pushes to master and manual runs always test.
# What a test reads belongs here: the config under test, the tests, their dependencies and pins.
^configuration\.yaml$
^(automations|scripts|scenes)\.yaml$
^fakesecrets\.yaml$
^(packages|blueprints|custom_templates|dashboards|custom_components)/
^tests/
^requirements_test\.txt$
^\.github/scripts/(extract_templates|install_custom_components|install-mosquitto)
^\.github/ha-versions/
^\.github/test-paths$
^\.github/workflows/(tests|e2e)\.yaml$
